      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a policy memo for our employees? It needs to address how we handle political expression in the office. We want to make sure everyone feels included and that we have a cohesive culture, but we also have to respect people's individual rights to their own views. Just a professional memo that balances those two things. Thanks.",
